==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[Mesocosmocyclone]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 25.33 seconds<sup>760f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Approaching this stage requires all of the [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] to be able to counter the Mesocosmocyclones at 10x magnification, as without them, the Cyclones will have even more health and DPS, making the stage much, much harder. Using anti-Alien and Relic counters will be able to counter most of this stage's threats. Should one own [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]], he will destroy the stage, as he deals ridiculous damage to the Cyclones and Oldhorn. If you have an extra slot, make sure to have a spammable unit, such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman]].

